                                                "sense_id": "c473835c-332f-3e82-8889-fe889bc2b929",
                                                "text": "Its nasty sting backs up the warning, and in the case of the cow killer, additional warnings also come in the form of sound, a squeak of broad frequency range that resembles a miniature rattle of a Lilliputian rattlesnake, and an odorous chemical warning signal."
